{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19164","headline":"吟白乐天哭崔儿二篇怆然寄赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"吟白乐天哭崔儿二篇怆然寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟君苦调我沾缨，能使无情尽有情。\n四望车中心未释，千秋亭下赋初成。\n庭梧已有栖雏处，池鹤今无子和声。\n从此期君比琼树，一枝吹折一枝生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}